commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T13:08:26Z","email":"jviolas@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeremie Violas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T13:08:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(*): add pre-release package workflow (#108)\n\n* ci(*): add pre-release package workflow\n\n- Automatically publish release candidates to npm\n- Trigger whenever release branches are updated\n- Generate version numbers using commit hashes\n- Use pre-release tags for early package testing\n\n* ci(*): trigger pre-release build on pull request\n\nUpdate the pre-release workflow to run when a pull request is opened or synchronized, instead of only on pushes to release branches. This allows for earlier validation of release candidates during the PR review process.\n\n* ci(*): switch pre-release to manual trigger\n\nAdded a check to ensure only proper release candidate branches can be published. This change provides more explicit control over when release candidates are generated.","tree":{"sha":"54aae395f38bf83f3cb7f2a11416c06637294870","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intuiface/intuiface-cdk/git/trees/54aae395f38bf83f3cb7f2a11416c06637294870"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/intuiface/intuiface-cdk/git/commits/817b460c44eb3d7ce7eed028fd7b3cc626b6c3d8","verification":{"payload":"tree 54aae395f38bf83f3cb7f2a11416c06637294870\nparent 57cabf1ad7d5f39871f9afda0b35a602bd69b61d\nauthor Jeremie Violas <jviolas@users.noreply.github.com> 1782133706 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782133706 +0200\n\nci(*): add pre-release package workflow (#108)\n\n* ci(*): add pre-release package workflow\n\n- Automatically publish release candidates to npm\n- Trigger whenever release branches are updated\n- Generate version numbers using commit hashes\n- Use pre-release tags for early package testing\n\n* ci(*): trigger pre-release build on pull request\n\nUpdate the pre-release workflow to run when a pull request is opened or synchronized, 