l":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fccn/openedx-platform/commit/f3aa7bfae9b1953525a7af3fd6d972fabce5f3a6","node_id":"C_kwDOFdbJFNoAKGYzYWE3YmZhZTliMTk1MzUyNWE3YWYzZmQ2ZDk3MmZhYmNlNWYzYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fccn/openedx-platform/commit/4637463e21a7fd8b0fcf51704e531a26c0d4829d","sha":"4637463e21a7fd8b0fcf51704e531a26c0d4829d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/commits/4637463e21a7fd8b0fcf51704e531a26c0d4829d"}],"sha":"f3aa7bfae9b1953525a7af3fd6d972fabce5f3a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/commits/f3aa7bfae9b1953525a7af3fd6d972fabce5f3a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3628148?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kdmccormick","id":3628148,"login":"kdmccormick","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MjgxNDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/commits/4637463e21a7fd8b0fcf51704e531a26c0d4829d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-09T15:19:05Z","email":"kyle@axim.org","name":"Kyle McCormick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-09T15:19:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat!: enable authoring MFE markdown editor waffle for everyone by default (#36876)\n\nThis adds a migration to turn on the new React-based Markdown editing option\nfor newly-created ProblemBlocks for all authors. The option is nested\nunder \"Advanced settings\", just like the Advanced (OLX) problem editor.\n\nThe migration is written such that it will *not* overwrite an existing global\n\"No\" waffle flag. Furthermore, our waffle utilities are designed such that\norg-level and course-level overrides will still take preference over the flag\nthat the migration creates. Therefore, this should only take effect in cases\nwhere no existing waffle flag applies.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Operators who do not want the new React-based Markdown editor\nto be shown should create a flag contentstore.use_react_markdown_editor with\nthe value \"No\".\n\nPrior art for flipping waffles like this: 9b0024376a8fb3cb3f7402747735f9985551ff9f\nBackport of: eb94113c840288bf3ecef1ee368087aaf27d27cc\nCloses: https://github.com/openedx/platform-roadmap/issues/384\n\nCo-authored-by: Muhammad Anas <muhammad.anas@arbisoft.com>","tree":{"sha":"d08a7c7c43bd80ed62830e9af194f41e58e5be2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/git/trees/d08a7c7c43bd80ed62830e9af194f41e58e5be2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/git/commits/4637463e21a7fd8b0fcf51704e531a26c0d4829d","verification":{"payload":"tree d08a7c7c43bd80ed62830e9af194f41e58e5be2b\nparent c318e47e53aceabfd3521b2be0a677cff8214f7f\nauthor Kyle McCormick <kyle@axim.org> 1749482345 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1749482345 -0400\n\nfeat!: enable authoring MFE markdown editor waffle for everyone by default (#36876)\n\nThis adds a migration to turn on the new React-based Markdown editing option\nfor newly-created ProblemBlocks for all authors. The option is nested\nunder \"Advanced settings\", just like the Advanced (OLX) problem editor.\n\nThe migration is written such that it will *not* overwrite an existing global\n\"No\" waffle flag. Furthermore, our waffle utilities are designed such that\norg-level and course-level overrides will still take preference over the flag\nthat the migration creates. Therefore, this should only take effect in cases\nwhere no existing waffle flag applies.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Operators who do not want the new React-based Markdown editor\nto be shown should create a flag contentstore.use_react_markdown_editor with\nthe value \"No\".\n\nPrior art for flipping waffles like this: 9b0024376a8fb3cb3f7402747735f9985551ff9f\nBackport of: eb94113c840288bf3ecef1ee368087aaf27d27cc\nCloses: https://github.com/openedx/platform-roadmap/issues/384\n\nCo-authored-by: Muhammad Anas <muhammad.anas@arbisoft.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoRvtpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7FcQAFhgjaWITpp9Lo09R2AnhQZP\nhtyodWl3ubjFEeFJ9n1GdzVj7HlEe1qL4YmR14K5O6wqTdA9/xEr5vm4GkwtpeKg\nxrkdC8PNCfiMhp+z68nxDwY6zTLIbtTuITHypC+ZtWm/3dpC5foKkyUQcAGNrR+D\ndron38ktl3Qqjp0cMSHfO4lpwcArGgZStu4hLxNGwjrypzyFdZLv64BznA9rOnCb\n7zY6e0eJXnjRT08pj1BVb/IYHItFu/nNbY/66txLfSUw670fSBRJCdiY6mXfbmK9\n2sMiGk/IE2x2JZL9bLsGUnfseu8P/ZFqeLcE3r18VhoCrkerDbZuXmQtelCIP9YL\neIT0pdwSCMO/rwPRopbmsXEBvVJLMJUnyVWHj5nMwprre6HqXUuaIyRbBNno6h9Y\nH9OvZABLNax3AQy4kcIcv0o0jcK9uPIWb8GKXo3aAIpvhIVk8O6Xn950I7QNmUdD\nweW25SukN2Z2s9idphfgmpedj5uLTF95r92KaP5AiQNlLq5k7RkKb3DTaOtkgxCk\nOCFEtYwlqkiws3y3/RO3bujSYzfv1iESKpCnFZqTwKnE4pe5JtFj+7pex0yFhSpf\n0VI7h++az1v+4igptU2XqsThpoREQ3h4AIEhZ8B21l6DQ8WeA/yEkBJ/jyckl4Ky\n8QWLi41/iLsUOg/tDXMz\n=bp2c\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-09-26T14:48:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com