owing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pomegranited/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pomegranited","id":7556571,"login":"pomegranited","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NTY1NzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pomegranited/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pomegranited/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pomegranited/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pomegranited/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pomegranited/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pomegranited","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/commits/8bcdfbf62027a141149061087cb91d3f2482792b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-22T15:22:33Z","email":"jill@opencraft.com","name":"Jillian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-22T15:22:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: recurse through pasted block data to replace static paths (#36723) (#36773)\n\nFixes an error that is triggered when trying to copy/pasting Drag-and-drop block into Courses.\n\nWhen a block is pasted into a Course or Library, we perform a search/replace on block''s data to replace any old static URLs with their new path. Ordinary blocks like HTML and Video have a simple string of data where static URLs may live, but DnDv2 blocks have a dict of data which can contain other dicts and lists of strings that need to be modified. Other XBlocks may have similarly complex structures, and so this fix will resolve them as well.\n\nThis fixes the issue by recursing into the data structure to locate all the strings where replacements may need to be made.\n\nThis fix helps Course Authors use content staging in their Courses.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 21399b48189a3766f2dd3e3347cab909e777a889)","tree":{"sha":"af17a5e1b2bb60eaa06a7055d41213d4c78dd699","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/git/trees/af17a5e1b2bb60eaa06a7055d41213d4c78dd699"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/git/commits/8bcdfbf62027a141149061087cb91d3f2482792b","verification":{"payload":"tree af17a5e1b2bb60eaa06a7055d41213d4c78dd699\nparent 6f05f70d66468dd0ba0a54e3b17eea0f861951d9\nauthor Jillian <jill@opencraft.com> 1747927353 +0930\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1747927353 -0500\n\nfix: recurse through pasted block data to replace static paths (#36723) (#36773)\n\nFixes an error that is triggered when trying to copy/pasting Drag-and-drop block into Courses.\n\nWhen a block is pasted into a Course or Library, we perform a search/replace on block''s data to replace any old static URLs with their new path. Ordinary blocks like HTML and Video have a simple string of data where static URLs may live, but DnDv2 blocks have a dict of data which can contain other dicts and lists of strings that need to be modified. Other XBlocks may have similarly complex structures, and so this fix will resolve them as well.\n\nThis fixes the issue by recursing into the data structure to locate all the strings where replacements may need to be made.\n\nThis fix helps Course Authors use content staging in their Courses.\n\n(cherry picked from commit 21399b48189a3766f2dd3e3347cab909e777a889)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoL0E5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiMYQAIz1XrtNrffhr4lYJ6AFEkqu\n6ObcDPMvvdVcpruSoqzwhTisAJ7NmBDGaklkZX6O9mf1/9yM2/SP6lcA3UjOJKXH\nBvL+UZoU8RFvBKzcvmGqiC1wCVRkGbOAyWS9+HJc73nIorSi/UUVAnafxbtAKz8N\nxCpkZo3pzUDiOHJ4uLqGE8DExUcud6XoVlvT6elY/qH8Ed0fQj9cQLudK1otr7Dd\nH005M9r/lK1XdCrFDgCzoqjkLI2CRZcqkzNpa4wyfJpnRPHOd9SCe8+BhXcEWz7Z\nTPGQFCKmYVjBFppqwlLcmcum/KRb0pyq3V3E18d5abbxW+N9ZUkKb4veCMquZDjm\nGTS7cAxV7PAVln6Df35oPGXNpf87v424iJ/AW5HLJiBcdxgz2SzpjkMaXWsdqzUh\nSvB1XljE4j4XhFhW0pjmLYUMHrZYrIP8Q8Ucwsqu7+wbRaI6teUeuU+DZ0eXUNvn\nCTRMdH1oXr0v+uZVb47upVEUERJEKrISL7uJlSIhODRp