api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/commits/1cd73d1b962dcbb93314d5fa5fdca50b5bcb6899/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-24T18:41:47Z","email":"navin@opencraft.com","name":"Navin Karkera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-24T18:41:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: support for syncing units from libraries to courses (#36553)\n\n* feat: library unit sync\n* feat: create component link only for component xblocks\n* feat: container link model\n* feat: update downstream api views\n* feat: delete extra components in container on sync (not working)\n* fix: duplicate definitions of LibraryXBlockMetadata\n* test: add a new integration test suite for syncing\n* feat: partially implement container+child syncing\n* fix: blockserializer wasn''t always serializing all HTML block fields\n* feat: handle reorder, addition and deletion of components in sync\n\nUpdates children components of unit in course based on upstream unit,\ndeletes removed component, adds new ones and updates order as per\nupstream.\n\n* feat: return unit upstreamInfo and disallow edits to units in courses that are sourced from a library (#773)\n* feat: Add upstream_info to unit\n* feat: disallow edits to units in courses that are sourced from a library (#774)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jillian Vogel <jill@opencraft.com>\nCo-authored-by: Rômulo Penido <romulo.penido@gmail.com>\n\n* docs: capitalization of XBlock\n\nCo-authored-by: David Ormsbee <dave@axim.org>\n\n* refactor: (minor) change python property name to reflect type better\n\n* fix: lots of \"Tried to inspect a missing...upstream link\" warnings\n\nwhen viewing a unit in Studio\n\n* docs: mention potential REST API for future refactor\n\n* fix: check if upstream actually exists before making unit read-only\n\n* chore: fix camel-case var\n\n* fix: test failure when mocked XBlock doesn''t have UpstreamSyncMixin\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Braden MacDonald <braden@opencraft.com>\nCo-authored-by: Chris Chávez <xnpiochv@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jillian Vogel <jill@opencraft.com>\nCo-authored-by: Rômulo Penido <romulo.penido@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Braden MacDonald <mail@bradenm.com>\nCo-authored-by: David Ormsbee <dave@axim.org>","tree":{"sha":"491d7762c1001c4e008b77cfca011859bf817bac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/git/trees/491d7762c1001c4e008b77cfca011859bf817bac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fccn/openedx-platform/git/commits/1cd73d1b962dcbb93314d5fa5fdca50b5bcb6899","verification":{"payload":"tree 491d7762c1001c4e008b77cfca011859bf817bac\nparent 875158f1adf0d7967d219c6729a2c3a24123d35b\nauthor Navin Karkera <navin@opencraft.com> 1745520107 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1745520107 -0700\n\nfeat: support for syncing units from libraries to courses (#36553)\n\n* feat: library unit sync\n* feat: create component link only for component xblocks\n* feat: container link model\n* feat: update downstream api views\n* feat: delete extra components in container on sync (not working)\n* fix: duplicate definitions of LibraryXBlockMetadata\n* test: add a new integration test suite for syncing\n* feat: partially implement container+child syncing\n* fix: blockserializer wasn''t always serializing all HTML block fields\n* feat: handle reorder, addition and deletion of components in sync\n\nUpdates children components of unit in course based on upstream unit,\ndeletes removed component, adds new ones and updates order as per\nupstream.\n\n* feat: return unit upstreamInfo and disallow edits to units in courses that are sourced from a library (#773)\n* feat: Add upstream_info to unit\n* feat: disallow edits to units in courses that are sourced from a library (#774)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jillian Vogel <jill@opencraft.com>\nCo-authored-by: Rômulo Penido <romulo.penido@gmail.com>\n\n* docs: capitalization of XBlock\n\nCo-authored-by: David Ormsbee <dave@axim.org>\n\n* refactor: (minor) change python property name to reflect type better\n\n* fix: lots of \"Tried to inspect a missing...upstream link\" warnings\n\nwhen viewing a unit in Studio\n\n* docs: mention potential REST API for future refactor\n\n* fix: check if upstream actually exists before making unit read-only\n\n* chore: fix camel-case var\n\n* fix: test failure when mocked XBlock doesn''t have UpstreamSyncMixin\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Braden MacDonald <braden@opencraft.com>\nCo-authored-by: Chris Chávez <xnpiochv@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jillian Vogel <jill@opencraft.com>\nCo-authored-by: Rômulo Penido <romulo.penido@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Braden MacDonald <mail@bradenm.com>\nCo-authored-by: David Ormsbee <dave@axim.org>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoCoXrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA90MQAFu+ZOKXKXrGMgxrADw6wEmO\n7+k5u1T9CxI08o7piZBG+qflSB2BA/Q/bi8ZhMM+DV+8oaiGWgXmAqV1//2dCuG/\naakHzQSbv6Oz+xKFHIlu0/7OFVsUhQpf0Rm2kvWv265pZ7Gi6v3SyXv0T3rOfJZ1\nYAHNSZlEX2suuXiM0vrb3nX2pkdHKzyVC3fLB7qpkWtnUU7tNA2cwHEq7gfFLIHw\n2+z2wdz+3+kAop+twMhFyHeIhZpKji4WI1HxaIJmgkzKPK7/zqn74TxdcL2JVkJ8\nQ8SbLyty+FpfRGiOx/+J4qWO7ig6xSgWkbnjkLkW7uANjYhJRym+YwJqtljWPsCk\nEH0BB0GTmyrV5y/12vwg3H40TKbbj6fljlQS/9euf1pQUGVQfLCI8w8xIb00WpLI\nrR6WYJC6GdXnlIe+4KVP3dEBRa4i0i75qTiU2QU0dnucs8O1vDZtvz5RisI5nJNM\nLCx4pLCYKVgeXzMcaL3X897iO87SmgbfMcu+rhy44EONzXqv0bbNwjJUdJQu3wYk\n3AXCMRtdztLsyi7WswjPZ5IJKvxwcQ+fG423yp/2DV3OQq4g0Fjxl3usucKRdcaw\nkhu4lXUHvfyvSQaD2XhbqNAOWdpqHTI50J7VCJVvBKMXnxGE3hz3QHKA8U+aq7zg\nncyGqc65gDMVjh5kBK