4606684/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T14:47:27Z","email":"ryok90@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Yokota"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T14:51:45Z","email":"ryok90@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Yokota"},"message":"ci: add deploy and preview workflows\n\n- deploy.yml: builds and deploys on main push and manual dispatch\n  - serialized concurrency (deploy-main) to avoid killing uploads\n  - git checkout with full history for lastModified()\n  - strict: pnpm check + astro build with ZE_SECRET_TOKEN\n\n- preview.yml: creates/updates/tears down preview environments on PRs\n  - integrates ZephyrCloudIO/zephyr-preview-environment-action@v1.0.0\n  - builds unconditionally (even on close) so action can resolve environments\n  - creates and maintains one deployment comment per PR\n\nBoth workflows:\n  - use pnpm version from packageManager field in package.json\n  - authenticate with ZE_SECRET_TOKEN repository secret\n  - check Node 22 and pnpm store health before building\n\nResolves action integration for both production and PR preview deployments.","tree":{"sha":"2a06dd9a5bdef0d6e53afefff88c4f763f092c6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryok90/yokota.dev/git/trees/2a06dd9a5bdef0d6e53afefff88c4f763f092c6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryok90/yokota.dev/git/commits/104552cc29cc15c0bd4604bf1798f1e9f4606684","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a06dd9a5bdef0d6e53afefff88c4f763f092c6e\nparent b8f16acc1ad5c949a5c5db7d7f9e86ec1e6c0159\nauthor Rodrigo Yokota <ryok90@gmail.com> 1789915647 -0300\ncommitter Rodrigo Yokota <ryok90@gmail.com> 1789915905 -0300\n\nci: add deploy and preview workflows\n\n- deploy.yml: builds and deploys on main push and manual dispatch\n  - serialized concurrency (deploy-main) to avoid killing uploads\n  - git checkout with full history for lastModified()\n  - strict: pnpm check + astro build with ZE_SECRET_TOKEN\n\n- preview.yml: creates/updates/tears down preview environments on PRs\n  - integrates ZephyrCloudIO/zephyr-preview-environment-action@v1.0.0\n  - builds unconditionally (even on close) so action can resolve environments\n  - creates and maintains one deployment comment per PR\n\nBoth workflows:\n  - use pnpm version from packageManager field in package.json\n  - authenticate with ZE_SECRET_TOKEN repository secret\n  - check Node 22 and pnpm store health before building\n\nResolves action integration for both production and PR preview deployments.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEI81kj9URlwdIi5LNRmDOkRPPJsIFAmqv8wEbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEEZgzpETzybCGFAP/2PEW+VDCAW9ZJl5y+d4\n4cL3+8hmEMtuA5DFBOlEU6DscqkeV4cM9xySpDOgw/9nIK2TAzkUHbsdU70jmD59\n9xjz517zQ5hydoyuVITnj91UHnTOjElphucoi0aKTYdyL8WFTuPU6UtcPqJvv6SF\nFgjz2KCtYYvzYKV6h7ydei1cGgi0AnWFBTRt6+y8kR5znmOlfnMqxQncr4W4qrWE\nSTEPEHqYxV7gsXgJlZMCTwg/UnpStZ5DOjHrM16XaeqRZsiza+1xNlIqTlL4V+wa\nW0cf9cp/FA8W98hHFD8Dpj87Afnn/YL7SrXV4dLoOQ5WAcCFlcG+xeCTTXcvBpH2\nFpa4dpmdeKarMV95tNzhrhKltP3IG1cvttbVlVyoPNt8820LZso+fGzc2hcomfkM\nR+dldbuxoCAKjZW9a0Z6EDCHXJuGK7ffnIn9c6/3mL8PO+aoLjlad0pTvDoeHQrO\nweWUN/151RqJN682oF+/ZoNwUHBiMo5cEP0is8kHCXBCCSb9LM09FARj6dyQcWeQ\n9JoudXWg822rW9u7gsok7MA49EupuUUdpoSe/oTnY2ht4c+G/SR36npi3NrK+d9i\nBhDMFUdJjLHNnSqxPNcMfvYZ7pVJ6Soq8j/1KIlALTPz8s2IqzXwParxxUYnvACA\nXvut0CQBID8KB9s1r6ftpJBt\n=wZvS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T14:51:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53323214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryok90","id":53323214,"login":"ryok90","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzIzMjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.gi