l.com","name":"Rodrigo Yokota"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T12:18:34Z","email":"ryok90@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Yokota"},"message":"fix: state each ticker topic once in the document\n\nThe marquee needs twelve passes on screen: six to keep a group wider than\nany viewport, doubled so the -50% keyframe loop is seamless. Materialising\nall of them as text put twelve copies of every keyword in the crawled DOM.\n\nOnly the first pass keeps its text now. index.astro emits the topics once as\ncustom properties on .ticker, and global.css labels the remaining eighty-eight\nspans through :empty:nth-child(16n + N)::before, so the strip is unchanged\nwhile the document names each topic once. Generated content is not page text.\n\nLayout is byte-identical: all 96 child boxes in both groups match the previous\nbuild at 1440px and 390px, group width stays 8394.84px, and the duration stays\n240s.","tree":{"sha":"abda600b4e6bc5e9f3ee7c697f47e32af52df81d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryok90/yokota.dev/git/trees/abda600b4e6bc5e9f3ee7c697f47e32af52df81d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryok90/yokota.dev/git/commits/91e42c9754d354510864df6885a4f401be2c3bac","verification":{"payload":"tree abda600b4e6bc5e9f3ee7c697f47e32af52df81d\nparent 64212e8fc93c0722f2ea7badc5498be04626f658\nauthor Rodrigo Yokota <ryok90@gmail.com> 1789301914 -0300\ncommitter Rodrigo Yokota <ryok90@gmail.com> 1789301914 -0300\n\nfix: state each ticker topic once in the document\n\nThe marquee needs twelve passes on screen: six to keep a group wider than\nany viewport, doubled so the -50% keyframe loop is seamless. Materialising\nall of them as text put twelve copies of every keyword in the crawled DOM.\n\nOnly the first pass keeps its text now. index.astro emits the topics once as\ncustom properties on .ticker, and global.css labels the remaining eighty-eight\nspans through :empty:nth-child(16n + N)::before, so the strip is unchanged\nwhile the document names each topic once. Gene