,"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ryok90/yokota.dev/commit/03e740e341f777cf5deace721c884a7194f5c90e","node_id":"C_kwDOFeKmf9oAKDAzZTc0MGUzNDFmNzc3Y2Y1ZGVhY2U3MjFjODg0YTcxOTRmNWM5MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ryok90/yokota.dev/commit/06afc61844086e4135255209b87520a57d322e02","sha":"06afc61844086e4135255209b87520a57d322e02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryok90/yokota.dev/commits/06afc61844086e4135255209b87520a57d322e02"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ryok90/yokota.dev/commit/5da3040d47d04bb359aafb953775867d512c282b","sha":"5da3040d47d04bb359aafb953775867d512c282b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryok90/yokota.dev/commits/5da3040d47d04bb359aafb953775867d512c282b"}],"sha":"03e740e341f777cf5deace721c884a7194f5c90e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryok90/yokota.dev/commits/03e740e341f777cf5deace721c884a7194f5c90e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53323214?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryok90","id":53323214,"login":"ryok90","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzIzMjE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryok90","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryok90/yokota.dev/commits/5da3040d47d04bb359aafb953775867d512c282b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:29:40Z","email":"ryok90@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Yokota"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:29:40Z","email":"ryok90@gmail.com","name":"Rodrigo Yokota"},"message":"feat: link the entity graph and date the sitemap\n\nSearch and answer engines had one isolated Person node per document and a sitemap\nwith nothing but a changefreq both Google and Bing ignore.\n\nThe JSON-LD is now a single @graph: a Person at #person, a WebSite at #website, and\na page node at <canonical>#webpage. Stable @id values are what join the entity across\nroutes. The homepage becomes the ProfilePage and names the person as mainEntity;\nevery other route stays a WebPage that is only about them. Person picks up the facts\nthe page already published: email, the AWS credential, languages, nationality, and an\noccupation category. Its image is the source portrait rather than the social card,\nsince 1200x630 with type on it is a poor entity image.\n\nSitemap entries now carry lastmod, derived from git history in src/lib/last-modified.mjs\nand shared with the page node''s dateModified. Git is the only honest source here: a\nfresh clone rewrites file mtimes to checkout time, which would claim every page changed\non every build. Without git history the date is omitted rather than invented.\n\nRefs #10","tree":{"sha":"7b506796818cb96fb319d3370f421ab2a50373fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryok90/yokota.dev/git/trees/7b506796818cb96fb319d3370f421ab2a50373fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryok90/yokota.dev/git/commits/5da3040d47d04bb359aafb953775867d512c282b","verification":{"payload":"tree 7b506796818cb96fb319d3370f421ab2a50373fa\nparent 067f8d664c4cb6d9e6986f725fd30c1fd8a0495d\nauthor Rodrigo Yokota <ryok90@gmail.com> 1789216180 -0300\ncommitter Rodrigo Yokota <ryok90@gmail.com> 1789216180 -0300\n\nfeat: link the entity graph and date the sitemap\n\nSearch and answer engines had one isolated Person node per document and a sitemap\nwith nothing but a changefreq both Google and Bing ignore.\n\nThe JSON-LD is now a single @graph: a Person at #person, a WebSite at #website, and\na page node at <canonical>#webpage. Stable @id values are what join the entity across\nroutes. The homepage becomes the ProfilePage and names the person as mainEntity;\nevery other route stays a WebPage that is only about them. Person picks up the facts\nthe page already published: email, the AWS credential, languages, nationality, and an\noccupation category. Its image is the source portrait rather than the social card,\nsince 1200x630 with type on it is a poor entity image.\n\nSitemap entries now carry lastmod, derived from git history in src/lib/last-modified.mjs\nand shared with the page node''s dateModified. Git is the only honest source here: a\nfresh clone rewrites file mtimes to checkout time, which would claim every page changed\non every build. Without git history the date is omitted rather than invented.\n\nRefs #10\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEI81kj9URlwdIi5LNRmDOkRPPJsIFAmqlRbQbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEEZgzpETzybCucgP/jiNdUi0+GD0bseqIhBE\nawuGlXrIBSAlqepnKl6hPlDNg4Ea5L5XPfesrrx27MCiNup21d3IS82HArZ5NJV5\n+Iu/mW8R6KbYWVp6+HKz7fZzcNZ/2oNW4TcI77m0UyelgyzBSeG84YFPDFi8qfTo\nuibBcjhBJIhGGkz+jNYWl8kjpxUVVxTFKkCb/FAHDmXUzWI1J7HY0gQhKMht18zn\nwlScx4qkK7GMfbhTBIX+TVmI6gDl5Ye6zIg+4PZYBCrvleQjpJVb3tzA0jhFfcnW\n8OGNN9zgn4L8hqq/o8SqvF/BsyyRRRAUrKA9kbSrh1VN7O6OSf/U+0RZKvIrxclB\nkA694QlPvV3ooVlzLaup06d9dFqUtbCGqOAjbxynD7riqsCK/Q/XXdRA1wxLp/IB\nbSUcAFHsoKfh99YzO17RaZk2e0D1LsR4l6F5OlHkDoJtkKYjaacn5EXvgv2kxZtC\nwgZLyGPcjM8kjcE8NdKQdihrd+bqJVyUs/kNdvRuKE3qZTxHZxcObmaHaul2w1ky\nvAdXrq0AX/VT3fqdyGc9z25lfaYBloZbnguGNfa1PfDZ1/8JoYQKpxgKfQau7MqO\nM8VQ/3YPTmjgMGyndcYc9pNyK5zxRHgDGiHSJhEbRVshQzNRnLWaPJnquR+Wbm9f\n2se9EcWFR03Ysb2+s1zoJb+f\n=j/D1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-12T12:30:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon