iskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commits/efb219c9581cc1db5a8ff1b83911934e2b5632d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:08:11Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:08:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Match the bed management header title by position, not tag (#2804)\n\nThe bed management header styles the page title through\n`& > p:last-child`. Change it to `& > :last-child` so the rule keeps\napplying when the framework renders the title as an h1\n(openmrs/openmrs-esm-core#1929). Without this, the title loses\n`white-space: nowrap`, so a long ward or page name could wrap.\n\nThe title is always the last child of the header labels, after the\noptional implementation name, so the rule matches the same element\nwhether the title renders as a p or an h1.","tree":{"sha":"37e83888ec635757d54bf0b9b4c43b464f69dcfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/trees/37e83888ec635757d54bf0b9b4c43b464f69dcfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/commits/efb219c9581cc1db5a8ff1b83911934e2b5632d9","verification":{"payload":"tree 37e83888ec635757d54bf0b9b4c43b464f69dcfc\nparent 1c3a5a09ee759f2f223cc9f779d067d0bc1a18f3\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1790950091 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790950091 +0300\n\n(fix) Match the bed management header title by position, not tag (#2804)\n\nThe bed management header styles the page title through\n`& > p:last-child`. Change it to `& > :last-child` so the rule keeps\napplying when the framework renders the title as an h1\n(openmrs/openmrs-esm-core#1929). Without this, the title loses\n`white-space: nowrap`, so a long ward or page name could wrap.\n\nThe title is always the last child of the header labels, after the\noptional implemen