.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commits/7fc1a562ee45f4fabc38f3d04da6cbb6a6d7274a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:52:25Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:52:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(chore) Remove leftover workspace v1 containers (#2790)\n\nRemoves the v1 WorkspaceContainer from the appointments patient overview,\nbed management, home, patient lists and patient search apps. These apps\nalready use workspace v2, which the app shell renders on its own, so the\ncontainers render nothing today.\n\nopenmrs-esm-core#1893 removes WorkspaceContainer from the framework. Once\nthat ships, these imports resolve to undefined and rendering them crashes\nthe page''s root component.\n\nAlso drops an unused DefaultWorkspaceProps type import from the ward\ncancel admission request test.","tree":{"sha":"bc0d7d3e984f5db31b69978c3f0e5fe4b4892412","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/trees/bc0d7d3e984f5db31b69978c3f0e5fe4b4892412"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/commits/7fc1a562ee45f4fabc38f3d04da6cbb6a6d7274a","verification":{"payload":"tree bc0d7d3e984f5db31b69978c3f0e5fe4b4892412\nparent c63da6eae7ac413ac92e9166d52c52b8375e59bb\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1790787145 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790787145 +0300\n\n(chore) Remove leftover workspace v1 containers (#2790)\n\nRemoves the v1 WorkspaceContainer from the appointments patient overview,\nbed management, home, patient lists and patient search apps. These apps\nalready use workspace v2, which the app shell renders on i