09731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commits/8eff6bab5486b7773d3cb7aa17e4cc310fa7715d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T22:58:55Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T22:58:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Declare react-dom as a peer dependency (#2784)\n\nAdd react-dom 18.x to peerDependencies in the bed management, patient list management, patient registration, patient search, service queues, and ward apps.\n\nThe app shell provides react-dom through module federation, but the\nOpenMRS rspack config only shares the dependencies an app lists in\npeerDependencies. Without react-dom listed there, the app loads the\ncopy of react-dom bundled into its own build instead of the shell''s.","tree":{"sha":"949e586ebaae934bff6475adcfd6552cf0979183","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/trees/949e586ebaae934bff6475adcfd6552cf0979183"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/commits/8eff6bab5486b7773d3cb7aa17e4cc310fa7715d","verification":{"payload":"tree 949e586ebaae934bff6475adcfd6552cf0979183\nparent b018b088c52ee679851883b3f48279ddf07e4476\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1790636335 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790636335 -0400\n\n(fix) Declare react-dom as a peer dependency (#2784)\n\nAdd react-dom 18.x to peerDependencies in the bed management, patient list management, patient registration, patient search, service queues, and ward apps.\n\nThe app shell provides react-dom through module federation, but the\nOpenMRS rspack config only shares the dependencies an app lists in\npeerDependencies. Without react-dom listed there, the app loads the\ncopy of react-dom bundled into its own build instead of the shell''s.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquvEvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKcwQAIs9BiVEsUnRc9ahwRFLjIXV\n/3B+RWfnlvCIKrZc6xK24P8zrBZ62G5xF0A0hiImp42EI5lcUJTt46u40w0I37jP\nw53mLR2M+6fdh7J6huSkGgcK8dvIu4q3O53f7Dv8SbismdRv+SuNiDIx8ebDbCwL\n+IEZjZs+dblbBBivaAr20I2T2s1kOSKesJER6x4c1ZUDC6DZuNpyZvL8T9/8HGId\nLg+PmE8yvgn0NjmjzvOnRORABvzT/oYG8dCTljmiBNH2wHBUe44/PZr51dNI5E6S\nK4zth3sECppACXX7N4toihZ/3WqVN0MaSiOdR9F08BU1rqAUBkRIpnNh2bQSz5h+\nUWNc/h2SbDGqpm0AUfSPkttPb0RUAdz/6m0UKrQ6+FSZcA1kzFJWZIoN0WiOykw+\n3VOFnO+YQnDmdKD85lLult0qnxX9LeTXuA6IIq9128ywrOmpqREOlCzspblefT3Q\nBe7AbmGKTlzCfcm0GiPadk8tYOuQFgIGegYcC6PT/STHqbvRG2CpFQ/myKPRtRZV\nM8TJaNpskJIRDXn7nRhg8MqviKxHx4pgaJsq79o2zxhwZwbhbHm9boIIKohRXCtX\nA2Kji2fUYuSLTWhZnN45RI4a8qv2tRQdS9uIDxdAllKZ1KJsm5RjyFNN4mr2SlfM\n69Xch3YSEfWCgeWrfT1D\n=TU4x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T22:58:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://ap