github.com/users/Isabirye1515/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isabirye1515/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isabirye1515/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isabirye1515/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isabirye1515/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Isabirye1515","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commits/7f4fac7f4ac911d4355063b5928399b8e06d1115/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:19:20Z","email":"150329678+Isabirye1515@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Elijah"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T21:19:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(test) Add E2E coverage for transfers between wards (#2119)\n\n* (test) O3-4836: Add e2e test for transfering a patient from a ward\n\n* Add cleanup steps after patient bed transfer tests\n\n* Fix to triger ci\n\n* Added ward 1 to example.env file\n\n* Time the transfer button to be available\n\n* resolving ci failures\n\n* resolving more ci failures\n\n* Change radio button click to check for transfer location\n\n* test: Complete ward transfer E2E coverage\n\nExercise the transfer request and acceptance in one test with an isolated session. Check that the source bed stays occupied while the request is pending, then clears when the destination ward accepts the patient, with the same visit still active.\n\nRestore the default ward location for existing bed helper callers and add the destination ward configuration. Reuse the ward page helpers and clean up the test beds, visit and patient.","tree":{"sha":"86ee73c96afe261f2259bf0c8e4a71d1ff90d05a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/trees/86ee73c96afe261f2259bf0c8e4a71d1ff90d05a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/