ed the cohort member key with the global\nmutate imported from swr. That function is bound to SWR''s default\ncache, while every hook rendered under the framework''s component\ndecorator lives in the decorator''s provider cache, so the call found\nnothing and the patient''s list memberships stayed stale after the\nsuccess snackbar. Take mutate from useSWRConfig instead, which is bound\nto the provider cache.","tree":{"sha":"1858f38507f6721086e6402f06fd91b2856168a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/trees/1858f38507f6721086e6402f06fd91b2856168a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/commits/dd5904929a290cb02803caa63066d44e3fc126a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commit/dd5904929a290cb02803caa63066d44e3fc126a7","node_id":"C_kwDOFfdDqNoAKGRkNTkwNDkyOWEyOTBjYjAyODAzY2FhNjMwNjZkNDR