ps://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commits/d9cbd2742a8d8842f6c7ae4d243254f195c06bd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T16:42:04Z","email":"nethmi@openmrs.org","name":"Nethmi Rodrigo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T16:42:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) O3-5984: Label in-service patients with the configured status name (#2750)\n\n* (fix) O3-5984: Label in-service patients with the configured status name\n\nThe queue page''s metric tile takes its label from the queue status concept\n(\"In Service\"), while the card list above the tables used a fixed\n\"Attending\" string, so the two disagreed. Derive the card heading, its error\nstate title, and the clinic overview''s column and totals card from the\nconfigured defaultTransitionStatus concept instead, falling back to\n\"In Service\" until the concept loads.\n\n* Update packages/esm-service-queues-app/src/attending-patients/attending-patients.test.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"342cdda83df80bd87318d3b26fc56d0241bb3358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/trees/342cdda83df80bd87318d3b26fc56d0241bb3358"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/commits/d9cbd2742a8d8842f6c7ae4d243254f195c06bd7","verification":{"payload":"tree 342cdda83df80bd87318d3b26fc56d0241bb3358\nparent afda17560cf7569d92cdf52c0f71944833df05ff\nauthor Nethmi Rodrigo <nethmi@openmrs.org> 1789663324 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789663324 +0000\n\n(fix) O3-5984: Label in-service patients with the configured status name (#2750)\n\n* (fix) O3-5984: Label in-service patients with the configured status name\n\nThe queue page''s metric tile takes its label from the queue status concept\n(\"In Service\"), while the card list above the tables used a fixed\n\"Attending\" string, so the two disagreed. Derive the card heading, its error\nstate title, and the clinic overview''s column and totals card from the\nconfigured defaultTransitionStatus concept instead, falling back to\n\"In Service\" until the concept loads.\n\n* Update packages/esm-service-queues-app/src/attending-patients/attending-patients.test.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrBhcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2QoQADizfPIhoN0fAMXZ661VOE8u\nm/e3STGgNoyapXOZ/FJnHAcPyyEsSugIEJazRAzw2ihKojxAkz+OvjBkHLQrVHhr\n9kC569UyaGRKfFDFhSvpBxYcB0e/+zz8H3oOycGPK0F+vl988CT1OXs2SvpOKakb\njLu7ElYTxqOwlZ4btHoeqyIhfpvKzEMhHdUmWcnj7lkUwYMI/ESoMaGVxaasRXTg\n8p+ENQ1OKaAL8K369OsmVrW14WhQvCzbefKKngzwGjRrmEybunYi9tBPW8cVsKmj\nO0MHy+pUhKteNIoFQJFL0p3J6nFiqYs3t1nnZOT99kzzWK6uoYeiAX/gifsLE1te\nPLK7haAarIWgERyU+UB13YowJ5Z4Rr1BILpp6YxH3tECkznOj/9TfM3CK7OZATlh\nca4u+JeS1ygJKNacMOU/1XjjwaOYqb2gUXXAvpJmg8e9kh2TXG/uG3Do73lZ5+tS\n+PJjkX4tYCRkgNUT0eVsmI0mJHxtQNhfx9fjPwc2MDdyqCBK+gcXUSp+UygBTXte\nd1Lvt/72hIoVsbm/ACIMYSiVNkafMMyIAEBAOdY2SMg8Y2RyIyfPu6dwo3qhGZZK\nZicpmZ7PvzzLZPVS1nOycVxENVxH4SuRhXqofMUh6MfjpSXZYMtqiywFqRWLsfSe\nxnkBCnEUCCZjNRmKN02i\n=aPa5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T16:42:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/