https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commits/d544f28a430707feba18e7f8b22f2c1b106577e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:27:53Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T10:27:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Open header patient search results with Enter (#2729)\n\n* fix: open header search results with Enter\n\nSelect the focused patient from the displayed search or recently viewed\nlist instead of expecting an array from the keyboard hook. Align the\ncallback type with the hook and preserve advanced-page form submission.\n\n* Reset stale header search selection\n\nClear the keyboard index when the query changes or the focused patient\nis replaced. Preserve it when background refreshes or appended pages keep\nthe same patient at that index. Cover the transitions with rendered tests.","tree":{"sha":"fe83703aceb27d259a1c2ceab00a47e779b5b43a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/trees/fe83703aceb27d259a1c2ceab00a47e779b5b43a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/commits/d544f28a430707feba18e7f8b22f2c1b106577e5","verification":{"payload":"tree fe83703aceb27d259a1c2ceab00a47e779b5b43a\nparent 324414d0c72d04ca6272e401180b9e0a9d1b847a\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1789036073 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789036073 +0300\n\n(fix) Open header patient search results with Enter (#2729)\n\n* fix: open header search results with Enter\n\nSelect the focused patient from the displayed search or recently viewed\nlist instead of expecting an array from the keyboard hook. Align the\ncallback type with the hook and preserve advanced-page form submission.\n\n* Reset stale header search selection\n\nClear the keyboard index when the query changes or the focused patient\nis replaced. Preserve it when background refreshes or appended pages keep\nthe same patient at that index. Cover the transitions with rendered tests.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqooYpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9OkQABHUWVY+ONNGME1/Aq+XyAo8\nhcS+Kr6osm0iHRYVGA0b8qi1eTXAFtDHjD3xFlUypW+/CUT60wVxza5+K0jUpfA8\ny4nIHDIgpdxpcaZU1pSACGykpQV+tSc+t7JQCf9QCRSCVSE9Q4gPUyk6Pjfxv5Z7\nyuS/gc1MSXspLkO2WUx/q10P5t2MTvBu5Si1c3Zbm+V4a+j+syf37ePI2cYzatik\nFnDI1Ue8A7OipQ5o1u4iAIKpf8zt/jQD20tN0RlfRAgLoLRWpO0oAnYlev+VBijW\np4rd4UuTLcYhtQJ6W7WvxLCyWfWhlnLrTltye8m1NkjvX0boSpkpe368pEmZKmbe\nwm1Q54xgl0nuUyjtdJ7rkU4W8WGJW/+8XfhQf9l4YJQ3zDHXxGufyXeu8kUJCTSE\ncCX/vT/meAQAhPJ69E294jz6mwpjsSD2t33jhLznOs5+DlNch0kOfsAkr6KfpbGe\n/1YIDeP2DQzAGpp14c8VT5InungnaU1Fo9uOwHN5U9hO2SUOl0AjT6EQkBnr8vO1\nlot0ZF17xT/FaLYLN8QZcmE/BZRhgghtlc6h+j1QPT0l6cKPxjWUGObXGYmKDwrj\nhjwuTB5kRG+uk/SgGWsi2bxq3io31i/avJYri9QRT7o6nLQUqcNrVxYoB4qWBvoa\ncmP74fnGcP5hYD5oHIQe\n=edwM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T10:27:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/w