eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commit/923bd8e1466edabca16a2340acaf4b441a8346ff","node_id":"C_kwDOFfdDqNoAKDkyM2JkOGUxNDY2ZWRhYmNhMTZhMjM0MGFjYWY0YjQ0MWE4MzQ2ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commit/fcb7a36a901fe4e7072a88dd88e6b6dd1ea72627","sha":"fcb7a36a901fe4e7072a88dd88e6b6dd1ea72627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commits/fcb7a36a901fe4e7072a88dd88e6b6dd1ea72627"}],"sha":"923bd8e1466edabca16a2340acaf4b441a8346ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commits/923bd8e1466edabca16a2340acaf4b441a8346ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/commits/fcb7a36a901fe4e7072a88dd88e6b6dd1ea72627/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:51:50Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T16:51:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Preserve patient search results when clearing attribute filters (#2728)\n\nNormalize cleared concept and location selections to an empty string so\nthey are no longer treated as active filters. Cover clearing and applying\nboth field types with regression tests, including missing attributes.","tree":{"sha":"66243e16acf7452cce7ef199b4c7f9954eed77db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/trees/66243e16acf7452cce7ef199b4c7f9954eed77db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-management/git/commits/fcb7a36a901fe4e7072a88dd88e6b6dd1ea72627","verification":{"payload":"tree 66243e16acf7452cce7ef199b4c7f9954eed77db\nparent b8335ad593a4946dd297a88e00c1fd6e6d1fc4f0\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1788886310 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788886310 +0000\n\n(fix) Preserve patient search results when clearing attribute filters (#2728)\n\nNormalize cleared concept and location selections to an empty string so\nthey are no longer treated as active filters. Cover clearing and applying\nboth field types with regression tests, including missing attributes.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoD0mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHwYQAGfuiC1mrARLdnbikHuEDBnm\nx1Pfgl/GlqTUUbfjwl2kQslUKcIjNCdwQ5Y6U7K9sKD9EnimJy34JS+gofLp7/kX\nBEPhJrb93bY7keIC4epdh1g9aM+5Z1srCl8F3d7Y9tZ0of0XXR2+YlwckQKImEcB\nTN86k8lYial+yickp2SVuAu7IL5kxAY82qQanNwne6hI2BTIHBl07u3aGnwSam5j\n2rzOb/0U2pzDizsIiUgy2GE3jmr5RnCElUKrcVZ4t7gbr2EksJpiRmc1/Pl2rpNC\n1xKMKEskvAd1X+Fia/mpFU5somJ5zXd1j+1F