ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/browniebroke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/browniebroke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/browniebroke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/browniebroke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/browniebroke","id":861044,"login":"browniebroke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MTA0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/browniebroke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/browniebroke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/browniebroke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/browniebroke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/browniebroke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/browniebroke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cozinhadosbonitos/sanity-studio/commits/aba6e299bcfc5f4c072754479c6652ca9f95757a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:37:25Z","email":"browniebroke@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bruno Alla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:37:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): resolve adm-zip and uuid Dependabot alerts via overrides (#1288)\n\nTwo transitive dependencies were pinned below their patched versions:\n\n- `@module-federation/dts-plugin` pins `adm-zip` to exactly `0.6.0`,\n  creating a nested copy alongside the already-patched `0.6.1` at the\n  root. Covers alerts #169-#175 (incl. 4 high severity: DoS via\n  uncontrolled memory allocation, decompression-bomb bypass, unhandled\n  deflate error, and SUID/SGID preservation on extraction).\n- `typeid-js` requires `uuid@^10.0.0`, resolving to `10.0.0`, which is\n  missing the buffer bounds check in v3/v5/v6. Covers alert #143.\n\n`adm-zip` uses a global override since 0.6.1 is the latest and every\nconsumer wants 0.6.x — this also prevents a future dependency from\nreintroducing a vulnerable copy. `uuid` is scoped to `typeid-js` because\nsanity legitimately resolves uuid 14.x elsewhere, and a global pin would\ndowngrade those.\n\nThe remaining `npm audit` findings all trace to the `braces` advisory\n(GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm), whose vulnerable range is `*` with no patched\nversion, so it is left alone.\n\nVerified: check:types, check:lint, check:format and build all pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a6b8bbbc7f636e9a597b94a9edee7bb7844446c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cozinhadosbonitos/sanity-studio/git/trees/1a6b8bbbc7f636e9a597b94a9edee7bb7844446c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cozinhadosbonitos/sanity-studio/git/commits/aba6e299bcfc5f4c072754479c6652ca9f95757a","verification":{"payload":"tree 1a6b8bbbc7f636e9a597b94a9edee7bb7844446c\nparent deec5891557daa4b02eeaf5826d1ccb260169a3f\nauthor Bruno Alla <browniebroke@users.noreply.github.com> 1791142645 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791142645 +0100\n\nfix(deps): resolve adm-zip and uuid Dependabot alerts via overrides (#1288)\n\nTwo transitive dependencies were pinned below their patched versions:\n\n- `@module-federation/dts-plugin` pins `adm-zip` to exactly `0.6.0`,\n  creating a nested copy alongside the already-patched `0.6.1` at the\n  root. Covers alerts #169-#175 (incl. 4 high severity: DoS via\n  uncontrolled memory allocation, decompression-bomb bypass, unhandled\n  deflate error, and SUID/SGID preservation on extraction).\n- `typeid-js` requires `uuid@^10.0.0`, resolving to `10.0.0`, which is\n  missing the buffer bounds check in v3/v5/v6. Covers alert #143.\n\n`adm-zip` uses a global override since 0.6.1 is the latest and every\nconsumer wants 0.6.x — this also prevents a future dependency from\nreintroducing a vulnerable copy. `uuid` is scoped to `typeid-js` because\nsanity legitimately resolves uuid 14.x elsewhere, and a global pin would\ndowngrade those.\n\nThe remaining `npm audit` findings all trace to the `braces` advisory\n(GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm), whose vulnerable range is `*` with no patched\nversion, so it is left alone.\n\nVerified: check:types, check:lint, check:format and build all pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwqr1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAc2sQAF+7gplMk3Q4yZbCHVZqfa4L\nRHxpoU+0uG3TtXkh/zxAydEH79w85o2wFyX7sbtxJ405JMDFZZEvEx/H/cnYtpJB\n34zbwSJanRv+NYAZMdWICCEfJCObnLLeArHAUWxUGRYF6c6ex8iYghENLmUotnPe\n84CbLzD78QE/womR83LwJTL2HzfymMnnKMazdvmgkBEib+0Z3dGXm3GTWvb0zHOo\nmTC9e3wuIGoplF5hut95lOfiNqU+o+zxK6E7DJTEH2h+HlPpx+o6b4WToijwpJ3H\nPBicpEpjudhXsMN+4nEVWyuUd56jjiSP4bA7Iwb39zt38chu79uzp+tTJHM4PgMv\nlMWXFuJOGqy2s4IWnnZzcfPp46W0FtSgRzCWWnyBtOXcdIgV7WB4d+AQ4+9gJF9H\nhx3KqQiwxIoFrBNrBmCbZrBrW26plJAudKvz44GiA2eRrihKUAYjajWViUKDhr13\nxgVfOf7/xLdF02aIAUBxCr9L77Tcg6bWWYqzSgEeLjUTFk89UAaFp3xLTEPidpNf\nrKsKa4VtRAHAcFjQauNtsS1JaZx6RtX2jf1xsf+BE3tbr6vHi+vmympduw/FDi5U\nrAWDxvpL9oPzH8EtEMDg/7VylJtWQcTvtMYi9t8E6qs4hFhZ5XnG6u8HEvc7Y1l7\nMHLsqPcbKwESoI9AC6xG\n=e0jG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T19:37:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-