"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/commits/3b18ee8d97490fc2a79c4b375e9ec93ce073d4c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:42:27Z","email":"andrew.s.lai5@gmail.com","name":"Andrew Lai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:42:27Z","email":"andrew.s.lai5@gmail.com","name":"Andrew Lai"},"message":"fix(theme): make Studio pages obey the global dark-mode toggle\n\nStudio/admin pages rendered inside AdminLayout, which wrapped them in a\nstatic, always-dark PrismThemeProvider disconnected from the global\nuseColorScheme context — so the dark-mode button never affected them.\n\nDrop the Prism wrap (AdminLayout''s only prod consumer) and the now-obsolete\ndisablePrismTheme prop so Studio inherits the global app theme and follows\nlight/dark exactly like the reader pages. All admin components are already\ntoken-driven, so they re-skin cleanly with no per-component changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"600d7277dcbbb5f0aa03ab84aa8df5a6a38d2570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/git/trees/600d7277dcbbb5f0aa03ab84aa8df5a6a38d2570"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/git/commits/3b18ee8d97490fc2a79c4b375e9ec93ce073d4c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20470077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id