ls inherited MUI body1 (1.3rem ~20.8px) and rendered *larger* than the\n13px cooking instructions, and the Gantt lane-label gutter (132px, ~16px\nmono) out-shouted the bars it labeled.\n\n- Add shared ingredientLabelSlotProps: ingredient checklist labels drop to\n  14px and inherit their container''s font, applied across the timeline\n  detail panel, mobile timeline, and shopping list.\n- Raise instruction steps 13 -> 15/1.6 and phase name 13.5 -> 14 so the\n  method is the largest body text.\n- Shrink Gantt GUTTER 132 -> 100 and set an explicit 12px lane label.\n- Promote the \"Ingredients\"/\"Full method\" section labels to 12px, tracked,\n  accent-colored so they read as headings.\n- Trim RecipePage meta/source to 0.9rem; bump the title to 700.\n- Tests: guard method >= ingredient sizing and a compact gutter.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32640452802e2aab924c110a4b83e1fe8334900a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/git/trees/32640452802e2aab924c110a4b83e1fe8334900a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/git/commits/118f89d8ac07cbbec6bf54513dd306fcb5cab816","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20470077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ALai57","id":20470077,"login":"ALai57","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDcwMDc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://ap