s://api.github.com/users/ALai57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/commits/2b02d0f904bc4996c089f32eb94a2b1dc9a626c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T23:04:12Z","email":"andrew.s.lai5@gmail.com","name":"Andrew Lai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T23:06:53Z","email":"andrew.s.lai5@gmail.com","name":"Andrew Lai"},"message":"feat: recipe wake-lock as a floating overlay with the Stirrer animation\n\nMove the recipe Keep-Screen-On control out of the header into a\nbottom-right floating overlay stacked above the global dark-mode icon,\nmirroring that icon''s treatment but clearly distinguishable: a pill vs a\ncircle, cyan accent vs neutral, cooking icon + label vs a bare glyph.\n\nOff, it''s a compact icon-only chip with a faint cyan ring; activating it\nexpands into a filled cyan pill showing the animated ''Stirrer'' — a\ntoqued two-joint cook whose wrist sweeps a spoon laterally in the pot,\nsteam above and heat flickering below. Monochrome currentColor recolors\nit for both contexts; animation respects prefers-reduced-motion. Safe-area\ninsets and right-anchored growth keep it correct on mobile and desktop.\n\n- New: StirrerIcon (+ test, story), WakeLockOverlay (view + container,\n  + test, story)\n- RecipePage: drop the inline button, mount <WakeLockOverlay />\n- Remove: WakeLockButton (+ test), replaced by the overlay\n- useWakeLock hook unchanged\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec35898d857551ea105d79ded85e813871df068a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/git/trees/ec35898d857551ea105d79ded85e813871df068a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/git/commits/2b02d0f904bc4996c089f32eb94a2b1dc9a626c8","verification":{"payload":nu