"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/commits/5b868306752cfedfebbb2d3d2f2972805358fe18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:54:16Z","email":"andrew.s.lai5@gmail.com","name":"Andrew Lai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:54:16Z","email":"andrew.s.lai5@gmail.com","name":"Andrew Lai"},"message":"fix(recipes): consistent section colors across views + test/guard hardening from review\n\nCookTimeline colored lanes by component index while RawRecipe/ShoppingList\ncolor by section index, so a section could show different colors across\nviews whenever component order/count didn''t match section order. Resolve\neach component''s section index and color from the same section-indexed\npalette Raw/Shopping use. Also guards MobileCookTimeline''s mini-Gantt\nagainst a divide-by-zero when total_minutes is 0, and adds regression\ncoverage: a RecipePage test locking in that checked ingredients survive\nview switches, and animateScrollTo tests exercising its real rAF animation\nloop and mid-flight supersession (previously only the two early-return\nbranches were tested).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db82c07806803d2257cd74bb3d7f848af0b7e0af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/git/trees/db82c07806803d2257cd74bb3d7f848af0b7e0af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ALai57/kaleidoscope-ui/git/commits/5b868306752cfedfebbb2d3d2f2972805358fe18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20470077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ALai57/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.c